[{"label":"The contract of a component","html":"<article class=\"paper\" data-variant=\"classic\" aria-labelledby=\"pe-title\">\n  <header class=\"paper-hero\">\n    <p class=\"paper-venue\"\n      ><span>defuss-shadcn · Architecture note · <time datetime=\"2026-10\">October 2026</time></span></p\n    >\n    <h1 class=\"paper-title\" id=\"pe-title\"\n      >The Contract of a Component<span class=\"paper-title-sub\">Seven artifacts, one schema</span></h1\n    >\n    <ul class=\"paper-authors\"\n      ><li>Aron Homberg</li\n      ><li>Claude</li></ul\n    >\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-abstract\" aria-labelledby=\"pe-abstract\">\n    <h2 id=\"pe-abstract\">Abstract</h2>\n    <p\n      >A component of defuss-shadcn is more than its stylesheet. It declares its states, documents them in a skill,\n      types them in a schema, shows them on a page, tests them in a fixture and is photographed in each of them, light\n      and dark. We draw these artifacts as an entity-relationship model; the verifier checks every relation in it on\n      every build.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n\n  <nav class=\"paper-toc\" aria-labelledby=\"pe-toc\">\n    <h2 id=\"pe-toc\">Contents</h2>\n    <ol>\n      <li\n        ><a href=\"#pe-s1\"><span class=\"paper-num\">1&nbsp;</span>Reading the model</a></li\n      >\n      <li\n        ><a href=\"#pe-s2\"><span class=\"paper-num\">2&nbsp;</span>Who checks it</a></li\n      >\n      <li\n        ><a href=\"#pe-cite\"><span class=\"paper-num\">·&nbsp;</span>Citation and references</a></li\n      >\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <figure\n    class=\"diagram paper-wide\"\n    id=\"pe-er\"\n    data-type=\"er\"\n    aria-label=\"The artifacts of one component and their relations\"\n  >\n    <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">ER · component contract</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-title\">What every component ships with</span>\n    </figcaption>\n    <div class=\"diagram-canvas\" style=\"--cols: 3; --diagram-gap-y: 4rem\">\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"skill\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Markdown</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Skill</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li>→ component</li\n          ><li>type</li\n          ><li>section</li\n          ><li>supported states</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"component\" data-tone=\"accent\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 1\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Component</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li># name</li\n          ><li>stylesheet</li\n          ><li>script (optional)</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"page\" style=\"--col: 3; --row: 1\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">MDX</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Page</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li># slug</li\n          ><li>→ component</li\n          ><li>live examples</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"schema\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 2\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">JSON</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Schema</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li>→ component</li\n          ><li>state types</li\n          ><li>actions</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"state\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 2\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">State</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li># name</li\n          ><li>→ component</li\n          ><li>config</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"fixture\" style=\"--col: 3; --row: 2\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">HTML + test</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Fixture</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li>→ component</li\n          ><li>every configuration</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"shot\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 3\">\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">PNG</span>\n        <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Screenshot</span>\n        <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\"\n          ><li>→ state</li\n          ><li>mode (light, dark)</li></ul\n        >\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <ol class=\"diagram-edges\">\n      <li\n        class=\"diagram-edge\"\n        data-from=\"component\"\n        data-to=\"skill\"\n        data-head=\"one\"\n        data-tail=\"one\"\n        data-from-label=\"1\"\n        data-to-label=\"1\"\n        >documented by</li\n      >\n      <li\n        class=\"diagram-edge\"\n        data-from=\"component\"\n        data-to=\"page\"\n        data-head=\"one\"\n        data-tail=\"one\"\n        data-from-label=\"1\"\n        data-to-label=\"1\"\n        >shown on</li\n      >\n      <li\n        class=\"diagram-edge\"\n        data-from=\"component\"\n        data-to=\"state\"\n        data-head=\"one-many\"\n        data-tail=\"one\"\n        data-from-label=\"1\"\n        data-to-label=\"1..*\"\n        >declares</li\n      >\n      <li\n        class=\"diagram-edge\"\n        data-from=\"component\"\n        data-to=\"schema\"\n        data-head=\"zero-one\"\n        data-tail=\"one\"\n        data-from-label=\"1\"\n        data-to-label=\"0..1\"\n        >typed by</li\n      >\n      <li\n        class=\"diagram-edge\"\n        data-from=\"component\"\n        data-to=\"fixture\"\n        data-head=\"one\"\n        data-tail=\"one\"\n        data-from-label=\"1\"\n        data-to-label=\"1\"\n        >tested by</li\n      >\n      <li\n        class=\"diagram-edge\"\n        data-from=\"state\"\n        data-to=\"shot\"\n        data-head=\"one-many\"\n        data-tail=\"one\"\n        data-from-label=\"1\"\n        data-to-label=\"2\"\n        >captured as</li\n      >\n    </ol>\n  </figure>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-section\" aria-labelledby=\"pe-s1\">\n    <h2 id=\"pe-s1\"><span class=\"paper-num\">1&nbsp;</span>Reading the model</h2>\n    <p\n      >Every component declares at least one state - <code>default</code> - and every state is captured twice, once per\n      colour mode. A schema types the states of 68 of the 229 components: every interactive one but the chart - which\n      the verifier lists as open debt - and nine native form and disclosure controls whose state is an attribute, such\n      as an input or a checkbox.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-section\" aria-labelledby=\"pe-s2\">\n    <h2 id=\"pe-s2\"><span class=\"paper-num\">2&nbsp;</span>Who checks it</h2>\n    <p\n      >Each relation is a gate of the verifier: a skill without its states fails, a schema whose states differ from the\n      page's table fails, a declared state without a screenshot or an end-to-end assertion fails. The diagram is the\n      documentation of rules a program already enforces.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"paper-bibtex\" aria-labelledby=\"pe-cite\">\n    <h2 id=\"pe-cite\">Citation and references</h2>\n    <figure class=\"bibtex\" data-formats=\"bibtex apa mla ieee\" aria-label=\"Cite this paper\">\n      <figcaption>Cite this paper</figcaption>\n      <pre><code class=\"bibtex-source\">@techreport{homberg2026contract,\n  title = {The Contract of a Component: Seven Artifacts, One Schema},\n  author = {Homberg, Aron and Claude},\n  institution = {defuss},\n  year = {2026},\n  month = oct,\n  url = {https://shadcn.defuss.org/papers/paper-schema.html}\n}</code></pre>\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"bibtex\" data-formats=\"ieee apa bibtex\" data-format=\"ieee\" aria-label=\"References\">\n      <figcaption>References</figcaption>\n      <pre><code class=\"bibtex-source\">@article{chen1976er,\n  author = {Chen, Peter Pin-Shan},\n  title = {The Entity-Relationship Model - Toward a Unified View of Data},\n  journal = {ACM Transactions on Database Systems},\n  volume = {1},\n  number = {1},\n  pages = {9--36},\n  year = {1976},\n  doi = {10.1145/320434.320440}\n}\n\n@misc{homberg2026defussshadcn,\n  author = {Homberg, Aron},\n  title = {defuss-shadcn: shadcn-style components as semantic HTML},\n  year = {2026},\n  howpublished = {GitHub},\n  url = {https://github.com/kyr0/defuss-shadcn}\n}\n\n@techreport{homberg2026vaepractice,\n  title = {Verified Agentic Engineering in Practice: A Component System Grown in One Month},\n  author = {Homberg, Aron},\n  institution = {defuss},\n  year = {2026},\n  month = oct,\n  url = {https://shadcn.defuss.org/papers/paper.html}\n}</code></pre>\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n</article>\n","individual":false}]
